        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Fidel Castro, Herbert Matthews, Fulgencio Batista\n- Organizations: 26th of July Movement\n- Places: Cuba\n\nFacts:\n- In 1940, Fulgencio Batista first served as President of Cuba.\n- Fulgencio Batista claimed that Fidel Castro had been killed during the 26th of July Movement.\n- Herbert Matthews later proved that Fulgencio Batista's claim about Fidel Castro's death was false.",
